eps them dropped across rebuilds. `~/.config/deja/exclude`\nskips "},{"id":"p25s2","text":"a project per line, or a whole store with `harness:opencode`. The\nsecurity model has the data flows "},{"id":"p25s3","text":"and what redaction cannot catch."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Local inverted index in `~/.cache/deja`: parse the JSONL and SQLite stores, redact\ncredentials, writ"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"e an append-only `records.bin` plus token buckets, and track per-file state in\n`manifest.gob` so rep"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"eat runs only ingest what changed. The MCP server, stats, share and\nsync all read that one index. De"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"tails in docs/ARCHITECTURE.md."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"},{"content":"上次校验失败；重新生成完整对象。evidence本次只选1至2条，每个编号必须从实际输入列表复制，不得推算或补造编号。保持摘要简洁，limitations最多3条。错误：["summary_length"]","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
